Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-17 (CC0 1.0: no rights
reserved) for the properties spec (section 3.4, Read a .cmp file): KiCad's
footprint association file (the format CvPcb and the board editor's Export
Footprint Association write, "Cmp-Mod V01") for the variants fixture. R1 and
R2 take 0805, R3 takes 0402, R4 keeps 0603, and R9 is a designator the
design does not hold. Each entry carries its symbol path as KiCad writes it.
